# Fold Protocol

Intent: allow the crystal to collapse and expand across scales.

## Fold

Compress structure into minimal anchors and routes without losing identity.

## Unfold

Reconstruct topology from anchors and Sigma intent.

## Constraints

- Identity preserved via anchors.
- No semantic loss.
